  { title: "Size and recommend", text: "Household size, water use, hardness and space decide the right softener. You get a clear recommendation and price before any work." },
  { title: "Clean installation", text: "Bypass valve, proper drain with an air gap, brine tank and connections installed by licensed plumbers, with the area left clean." },
  { title: "Set up and show you", text: "We program the regeneration settings, fill the salt, test for soft water and show you how to look after it." },
